# Classification evaluation set (SRC-05, WAT-03, AGT-07, playbook 16). One JSON object per line; lines starting with # are comments.
# Fields: id, language, jurisdiction, authority (label as published), source (prototype:<id> or authored), text, expected
#   {change_type (vocabulary key), flags (flag keys), scope {regime, account_type, service_type: term keys}, risk_flags},
#   injection (true for the AGT-07 screen cases), injection_kind, note. A row may carry predictions ({change_type, flags, scope, risk_flags}).
