# Scope is what the text touches, in the footprint dimensions that restrict matching. An empty list means the text names nothing in that dimension.
{"id": "c-01", "language": "en", "jurisdiction": "SE", "authority": "Finansinspektionen", "source": "prototype:c1", "text": "FI adopts amended rules on paying for investment research. FI's board decided on 15 September 2026 to amend three regulations in the securities area following changed EU rules. Institutions that receive research must set criteria for an annual assessment of its quality, usability and value, and take action if the research does not contribute to better investment decisions.", "expected": {"change_type": "adopted", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["securities"], "account_type": ["isk", "af", "depa", "kf"], "service_type": ["advice", "portfolio_management"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
