{"id": "c-09", "language": "sv", "jurisdiction": "SE", "authority": "Finansinspektionen", "source": "authored", "text": "FI remitterar ändrade regler om ersättningar från tredje part. Finansinspektionen föreslår ändringar i FFFS 2017:2 som skärper kraven på när ett värdepappersinstitut får ta emot analys från tredje part. Synpunkter lämnas senast den 14 november 2026. Reglerna föreslås träda i kraft den 1 april 2027.", "expected": {"change_type": "consultation", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["securities"], "account_type": ["isk", "af", "depa", "kf"], "service_type": ["advice", "portfolio_management"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-10", "language": "en", "jurisdiction": "EU", "authority": "ESMA", "source": "authored", "text": "ESMA publishes final guidelines on suitability with sustainability preferences. The guidelines clarify how firms collect sustainability preferences, how they match them to products and how the suitability report explains a mismatch. They apply from 3 March 2027 and national authorities must notify whether they comply.", "expected": {"change_type": "guidance", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["securities"], "account_type": ["isk", "af", "depa"], "service_type": ["advice", "portfolio_management"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-11", "language": "da", "jurisdiction": "DK", "authority": "Finanstilsynet", "source": "authored", "text": "Finanstilsynet påtaler manglende egnethedsvurdering hos fondsmæglerselskab. Selskabet har ydet investeringsrådgivning til detailkunder uden at indhente tilstrækkelige oplysninger om kundernes økonomiske forhold og investeringsformål. Finanstilsynet påbyder selskabet at rette op på procedurerne inden den 1. december 2026.", "expected": {"change_type": "enforcement", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["securities"], "account_type": [], "service_type": ["advice"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-12", "language": "nb", "jurisdiction": "NO", "authority": "Finanstilsynet", "source": "authored", "text": "Finanstilsynet varsler tematilsyn om kostnadsopplysninger til ikke-profesjonelle kunder. Tilsynet vil undersøke om verdipapirforetak gir samlede opplysninger om kostnader og gebyrer før tjenesten ytes og minst årlig etterpå. Utvalgte foretak får brev i oktober 2026 og en rapport ventes våren 2027.", "expected": {"change_type": "supervision", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["securities"], "account_type": [], "service_type": ["advice", "non_advised", "execution_only", "portfolio_management"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-13", "language": "fi", "jurisdiction": "FI", "authority": "Finanssivalvonta", "source": "authored", "text": "Finanssivalvonta muistuttaa avaintietoasiakirjan toimittamisesta ennen sopimuksen tekemistä. Valvottavatiedotteessa todetaan, että vakuutusmuotoisten sijoitustuotteiden avaintietoasiakirja on annettava ei-ammattimaiselle asiakkaalle hyvissä ajoin ennen kuin asiakas sitoutuu sopimukseen. Puutteita on havaittu digitaalisissa myyntikanavissa.", "expected": {"change_type": "supervision", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["insurance"], "account_type": ["kf", "pension"], "service_type": ["insurance_distribution"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-14", "language": "en", "jurisdiction": "EU", "authority": "European Commission", "source": "authored", "text": "Commission adopts delegated regulation amending the PRIIPs key information document. The changes introduce a layered digital format and new performance scenarios. Published in the Official Journal on 21 August 2026, the regulation applies from 1 January 2028 unless the Parliament or the Council objects within three months.", "expected": {"change_type": "adopted", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["insurance", "securities"], "account_type": ["kf", "pension"], "service_type": ["insurance_distribution", "advice"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-15", "language": "sv", "jurisdiction": "SE", "authority": "Skatteverket", "source": "authored", "text": "Kontrolluppgifter för investeringssparkonto ska lämnas senast den 31 januari 2027. Skatteverket påminner om att schablonintäkten för varje ISK ska rapporteras i den årliga kontrolluppgiften och att filspecifikationen för inkomstår 2026 är oförändrad.", "expected": {"change_type": "recurring_date", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["tax"], "account_type": ["isk"], "service_type": ["custody"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-16", "language": "en", "jurisdiction": "EU", "authority": "EBA", "source": "authored", "text": "EBA launches consultation on technical standards for customer due diligence under the AMLR. The draft standards set out the information to collect at onboarding and on periodic review, and the risk factors that allow simplified measures. The consultation runs until 12 December 2026.", "expected": {"change_type": "consultation", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["aml"], "account_type": ["isk", "af", "depa", "kf", "pension"], "service_type": ["advice", "non_advised", "execution_only", "portfolio_management", "custody", "insurance_distribution"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-17", "language": "sv", "jurisdiction": "SE", "authority": "Integritetsskyddsmyndigheten", "source": "authored", "text": "IMY beslutar om sanktionsavgift på 30 miljoner kronor för automatiserade kreditbeslut. Bolaget nekade kunder krediter enbart genom automatiserad behandling utan att erbjuda mänskligt ingripande eller informera om rätten att invända. IMY konstaterar att artikel 22 i dataskyddsförordningen inte har följts.", "expected": {"change_type": "enforcement", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["data_protection"], "account_type": [], "service_type": []}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-18", "language": "en", "jurisdiction": "EU", "authority": "ESMA", "source": "authored", "text": "ESMA statement on the use of artificial intelligence in retail investment services. Firms that use AI in advice, portfolio management or client interaction remain fully responsible for MiFID II obligations, including suitability, appropriateness and best interest. ESMA expects governance, oversight and documented testing of models that affect clients.", "expected": {"change_type": "supervision", "flags": ["ai"], "scope": {"regime": ["securities", "ai_ict"], "account_type": [], "service_type": ["advice", "non_advised", "portfolio_management"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-19", "language": "da", "jurisdiction": "DK", "authority": "Finanstilsynet", "source": "authored", "text": "Ny bekendtgørelse om investorbeskyttelse ved værdipapirhandel trådte i kraft den 1. juli 2026. Bekendtgørelsen gennemfører de reviderede krav til hensigtsmæssighedsvurdering og advarsler ved handel med komplekse instrumenter uden rådgivning. Finanstilsynet har opdateret sin vejledning samme dag.", "expected": {"change_type": "in_force", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["securities"], "account_type": [], "service_type": ["non_advised", "execution_only"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-20", "language": "nb", "jurisdiction": "NO", "authority": "Finansdepartementet", "source": "authored", "text": "Regjeringen fremmer lovforslag om gjennomføring av DORA i norsk rett. Proposisjonen foreslår en ny lov om digital operasjonell motstandsdyktighet i finanssektoren og endringer i finanstilsynsloven. Forslaget behandles i Stortinget høsten 2026 og loven foreslås å tre i kraft 1. juli 2027.", "expected": {"change_type": "proposal", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["ai_ict"], "account_type": [], "service_type": ["advice", "non_advised", "execution_only", "portfolio_management", "custody", "insurance_distribution"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-21", "language": "fi", "jurisdiction": "FI", "authority": "Verohallinto", "source": "authored", "text": "Verohallinto vahvistaa vuosi-ilmoitusten määräajat vuodelle 2027. Sijoituspalveluyritysten ja säilyttäjien on annettava vuosi-ilmoitukset arvopaperien myynneistä ja osakesäästötilin tapahtumista viimeistään 31. tammikuuta 2027. Tietuekuvaukset on julkaistu.", "expected": {"change_type": "recurring_date", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["tax"], "account_type": [], "service_type": ["custody"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-22", "language": "en", "jurisdiction": "EU", "authority": "Court of Justice of the European Union", "source": "authored", "text": "Court of Justice rules on the meaning of investment advice under MiFID II. In a preliminary ruling the Court finds that a personalised message in a trading app suggesting a specific instrument to a named client can constitute investment advice even when the firm labels the service as execution only. National courts must assess the presentation, not the label.", "expected": {"change_type": "court_ruling", "flags": ["advice_perimeter"], "scope": {"regime": ["securities"], "account_type": [], "service_type": ["advice", "non_advised", "execution_only"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-23", "language": "sv", "jurisdiction": "SE", "authority": "Högsta förvaltningsdomstolen", "source": "authored", "text": "HFD avgör hur schablonintäkt på ISK beräknas vid dödsfall under året. Domstolen slår fast att kapitalunderlaget beräknas fram till dödsdagen och att dödsboet inte ska påföras schablonintäkt för resterande kvartal. Skatteverket ändrar sitt ställningstagande.", "expected": {"change_type": "court_ruling", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["tax"], "account_type": ["isk"], "service_type": ["custody"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-24", "language": "en", "jurisdiction": "EU", "authority": "Council of the EU", "source": "authored", "text": "Council agrees its negotiating position on the Retail Investment Strategy. The general approach drops the partial inducement ban in favour of a best-interest test, keeps value-for-money benchmarks and adds a lighter suitability regime for simple products. Trilogues with the Parliament start in the autumn of 2026.", "expected": {"change_type": "proposal", "flags": ["advice_perimeter"], "scope": {"regime": ["securities", "insurance"], "account_type": ["isk", "af", "depa", "kf", "pension"], "service_type": ["advice", "non_advised", "insurance_distribution"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-25", "language": "sv", "jurisdiction": "SE", "authority": "Finansinspektionen", "source": "authored", "text": "FI beslutar om ändrade föreskrifter om försäkringsdistribution. Ändringarna i FFFS 2018:10 skärper dokumentationskravet vid rådgivning om byte av underliggande placeringar i kapital- och pensionsförsäkringar. Föreskrifterna träder i kraft den 1 mars 2027.", "expected": {"change_type": "adopted", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["insurance"], "account_type": ["kf", "pension"], "service_type": ["insurance_distribution", "advice"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-26", "language": "da", "jurisdiction": "DK", "authority": "Datatilsynet", "source": "authored", "text": "Datatilsynet udgiver vejledning om profilering i digitale investeringsløsninger. Vejledningen beskriver, hvornår en automatisk vurdering af kundens risikoprofil er en afgørelse efter databeskyttelsesforordningens artikel 22, og hvilke sikkerhedsforanstaltninger der kræves. Vejledningen gælder straks.", "expected": {"change_type": "guidance", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["data_protection"], "account_type": [], "service_type": ["non_advised", "execution_only"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-27", "language": "nb", "jurisdiction": "NO", "authority": "Finanstilsynet", "source": "authored", "text": "Finanstilsynet ilegger overtredelsesgebyr på 12 millioner kroner for mangelfull kundekontroll. Banken hadde ikke oppdatert kundeopplysninger ved løpende oppfølging og manglet risikobasert tilnærming til høyrisikokunder. Vedtaket kan påklages til Finansdepartementet.", "expected": {"change_type": "enforcement", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["aml"], "account_type": [], "service_type": []}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-28", "language": "fi", "jurisdiction": "FI", "authority": "Finanssivalvonta", "source": "authored", "text": "Finanssivalvonta julkaisee valvottavatiedotteen tekoälyn käytöstä finanssialalla. Tiedote kuvaa Finanssivalvonnan odotukset tekoälyjärjestelmien hallinnasta, riskienhallinnasta ja asiakasvaikutusten arvioinnista sekä tekoälyasetuksen soveltamisen aikataulun. Kysely valvottaville lähetetään lokakuussa 2026.", "expected": {"change_type": "supervision", "flags": ["ai"], "scope": {"regime": ["ai_ict"], "account_type": [], "service_type": []}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
