{"id": "c-31", "language": "en", "jurisdiction": "EU", "authority": "ESMA", "source": "authored", "text": "ESMA updates its Q&A on costs and charges: currency conversion costs belong in the ex-ante disclosure. Where a client buys an instrument in a foreign currency, the FX margin is a cost of the service and must appear in the aggregated ex-ante figure and the annual ex-post statement.", "expected": {"change_type": "guidance", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["securities"], "account_type": ["isk", "af", "depa"], "service_type": ["advice", "non_advised", "execution_only", "portfolio_management"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-32", "language": "da", "jurisdiction": "DK", "authority": "Finanstilsynet", "source": "authored", "text": "Finanstilsynet undersøger digitale nudges i handelsapps. Undersøgelsen ser på, om advarsler ved handel med komplekse produkter kan klikkes væk med ét tryk, og om apps bruger belønninger og notifikationer til at øge handelsaktiviteten. Resultaterne offentliggøres i første kvartal 2027.", "expected": {"change_type": "supervision", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["securities"], "account_type": [], "service_type": ["non_advised", "execution_only"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-33", "language": "nb", "jurisdiction": "NO", "authority": "Skatteetaten", "source": "authored", "text": "Frist for innrapportering av aksjesparekonto er 31. januar 2027. Skatteetaten minner tilbydere om at innskudd, uttak og verdier per 31. desember skal rapporteres i tredjepartsopplysninger innen fristen. Formatet for inntektsåret 2026 er uendret.", "expected": {"change_type": "recurring_date", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["tax"], "account_type": [], "service_type": ["custody"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
{"id": "c-34", "language": "fi", "jurisdiction": "FI", "authority": "Finanssivalvonta", "source": "authored", "text": "Finanssivalvonta määrää seuraamusmaksun puutteellisesta soveltuvuusarvioinnista. Sijoituspalveluyritys oli antanut sijoitusneuvontaa selvittämättä asiakkaan taloudellista tilannetta ja tavoitteita riittävästi. Seuraamusmaksu on 400 000 euroa ja päätös on julkinen.", "expected": {"change_type": "enforcement", "flags": [], "scope": {"regime": ["securities"], "account_type": [], "service_type": ["advice"]}, "risk_flags": []}, "injection": false}
